{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"login"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"request"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Vapor7RequestC","text":"Request"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Vapor8ResponseC","text":"Response"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"request","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Vapor request to the endpoint ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/LoginRequestDto","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"User’s access tokens.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With this endpoint, users can log in to the system using their username or their email and password."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Two tokens are returned in response. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessToken"},{"type":"text","text":" must be sent in every request that requires confirmation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the user’s identity. The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"refreshToken"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MUST"}]},{"type":"text","text":" be sent only to replace the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessToken"},{"type":"text","text":" before it expires."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The default expiration time for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessToken"},{"type":"text","text":" is 1 hour. The expiration time of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"refreshToken"},{"type":"text","text":" is 30 days."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Endpoint URL: "},{"code":"\/api\/v1\/account\/login","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"name":"Important","style":"important","type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"CURL request:"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"bash","code":["curl \"https:\/\/example.com\/api\/v1\/account\/login\" \\","-X POST \\","-H \"Content-Type: application\/json\" \\","-d '{ ... }'"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Example request body:"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"json","code":["{","    \"userNameOrEmail\": \"johndoe\",","    \"password\": \"P@ssword1!\"","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Example response body:","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"json","code":["{","    \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJSUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJyb2xlcyI6W10sInVzZXJOYW1lIjoibmlja2Z...\",","    \"refreshToken\": \"8v4JbrTeboHsD5T24WdhkkHgVx3UQ2F2FQaZd3sT0\"","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoginError.invalidLoginCredentials"},{"text":" if given user name or password are invalid.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Throws","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoginError.userAccountIsBlocked"},{"text":" if user account is blocked. User cannot login to the system right now.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Throws","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoginError.userAccountIsNotApproved"},{"type":"text","text":" if user account is not aprroved yet. User cannot login to the system right now."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Throws","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoginError.saltCorrupted"},{"text":" if password has been corrupted. Please contact with portal administrator.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Throws","style":"note","type":"aside"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/AccountController\/login(request:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer","doc:\/\/VernissageServer\/documentation\/VernissageServer\/AccountController"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","title":"login(request:)","modules":[{"name":"Vernissage"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:16VernissageServer17AccountControllerV5login7request5Vapor8ResponseCAF7RequestC_tYaYbKF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"login"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"request"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5Vapor7RequestC","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Request"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:5Vapor8ResponseC","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Response"}]},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Sign-in user via login (usernane or email) and password.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/vernissageserver\/accountcontroller\/login(request:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"referenc